      "remarks": "The obligation set that applies to a provider of an AI system classified as high-risk under Article 6(2) (Annex III) from 2 December 2027. That date is the one set by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, which deferred it from 2 August 2026; any readiness plan still working to the August 2026 date is working to a superseded deadline. Statutory parameters are pre-set to the values fixed by the Regulation and must not be relaxed. Organisation-defined parameters (risk-management review interval, accuracy metric and threshold, robustness test interval, quality-management review interval, technical-documentation review interval) are deliberately left unset: a consumer of this profile is expected to set them, and an assessment that finds them unset has found a real gap. Article 50 is included because a high-risk system may independently be in scope for the transparency obligations. Providers of systems high-risk under Article 6(1) (Annex I products) should note the 2 August 2028 application date for that limb."
    },
